          <p class="pub-item-note">Defense passed. Deposit pending release of unpublished experimental results.</p>
        </li>

        <li class="pub-item">
          <span class="pub-type-tag">Published</span>
          <p class="pub-item-title">
            Investigation of the cross-border movement of PM<sub>2.5</sub> in the Terai Belt of Nepal
            using a low-cost sensor network
          </p>
          <p class="pub-item-authors">
            Shrestha, H.*, <strong>Karna, A.*</strong>, de Foy, B., Bhave, P. V., Sapkota, R. P.,
            Byanju, R. M., Bergin, M. H., &amp; McAdoo, B.
          </p>
          <p class="pub-item-venue"><em>Atmospheric Pollution Research</em>, Elsevier (2026)</p>
          <p class="pub-item-note">* Co-first author</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 0.65rem;">
            <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apr.2026.102920" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">
              <i class="fas fa-external-link-alt"></i> View Article
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>

      </ul>
    </div>
